Template: aegis/domain
Type: string
Default: aegis.local
Description: Public hostname for the Aegis dashboard:
 Enter the DNS name users will open in a browser, for example
 soc.example.com. The default aegis.local uses Caddy's internal CA and is
 suitable for a lab. A public hostname requires DNS pointing at this host and
 ports 80/443 reachable for ACME.

Template: aegis/acme_email
Type: string
Default: internal
Description: ACME account email for the public certificate:
 Use a real operator address when aegis/domain is a public hostname. Keep
 "internal" only for the lab/internal-CA default.

Template: aegis/ui_port
Type: string
Default: 3000
Description: Local dashboard port:
 The dashboard is bound to 127.0.0.1 on this TCP port. If it is occupied,
 the package automatically selects the first free port in 3000-3099 and
 records it in /etc/aegis/server.env.
